@GameOfLife_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041
@boardId = 0

### Health check
GET {{GameOfLife_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Upload a board as sparse [x, y] pairs (a blinker). Returns the new id.
POST {{GameOfLife_HostAddress}}/api/boards
Content-Type: application/json

{ "liveCells": [[0, 0], [1, 0], [2, 0]] }

### Upload a board as a dense grid (a 2x2 block). Returns the new id.
POST {{GameOfLife_HostAddress}}/api/boards/from-grid
Content-Type: application/json

{ "grid": [[true, true], [true, true]] }

### Get a board's current state (safe, side-effect-free read).
GET {{GameOfLife_HostAddress}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}
Accept: application/json

### Advance the board one step (POST: mutates and persists the board's state).
POST {{GameOfLife_HostAddress}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/next

### Advance the board N steps (here: 5).
POST {{GameOfLife_HostAddress}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/states/5

### Drive the board to its settled/final state; returns 422 if it doesn't settle within maxIterations.
POST {{GameOfLife_HostAddress}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/final?maxIterations=1000
